    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Ecommerce Cart Summarys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Summary Retrieval API provides a comprehensive overview of the contents of a user's shopping cart. This endpoint allows businesses to display cart details including item quantities, pricing, and total cost. Typical consumers of this API include e-commerce platforms, online retailers, and mobile shopping applications that require real-time cart information. By integrating this API, developers can enhance user experience by ensuring that customers can view and confirm their cart contents seamlessly.",
